WEBVTT

00:00:06.614 --> 00:00:07.339
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.273 --> 00:00:11.445
<v><b>M:</b></v> We’re all stressed because we’re working to a tight schedule.

00:00:13.795 --> 00:00:14.517
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.622 --> 00:00:18.406
<v><b>M:</b></v> There’s space for three cars in their garage.

00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:21.305
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.084
<v><b>F:</b></v> I only just had time to grab a sandwich.

00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:28.095
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:33.335
<v><b>F:</b></v> I know I enjoyed the meal, but I can’t remember exactly what I ate.

00:00:34.729 --> 00:00:35.587
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:39.133
<v><b>F:</b></v> She accused the media of harassment.

00:00:41.072 --> 00:00:41.904
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:43.002 --> 00:00:45.470
<v><b>F:</b></v> He couldn’t read the address on the envelope.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.414
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:49.498 --> 00:00:51.862
<v><b>M:</b></v> The others left the room to give us some privacy.

00:00:53.749 --> 00:00:54.471
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:55.537 --> 00:00:58.422
<v><b>M:</b></v> Her latest novel has caused a lot of controversy.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.153
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:02.302 --> 00:01:05.375
<v><b>F:</b></v> I don’t tend to go to the doctor’s very often.

00:01:07.623 --> 00:01:08.390
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:09.342 --> 00:01:11.403
<v><b>M:</b></v> She looked up as I entered the room.

00:01:13.456 --> 00:01:14.380
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:19.412
<v><b>F:</b></v> It isn’t far to the station – just over a kilometre.

00:01:21.705 --> 00:01:22.496
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:23.386 --> 00:01:26.065
<v><b>F:</b></v> The course starts tomorrow and finishes on Friday.